<title>HUNGARY: Novotrade buys stake in GarAgent.</title>
<headline>Novotrade buys stake in GarAgent.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian holding company Novotrade Rt acquired a 28.94 percent stake in Hungarian garage services company GarAgent through one of its subsidiaries, Novotrade said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>GarAgent has an issued share capital of 381.85 million forints, while Novotrade's capital amounts to 554.28 million forints.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
